('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['G02','PV02','N09-01'],'Did archived P09-v1 authorize N09 at September 21 10:00?',['P09-v1 ended September 19 at 23:59 and was superseded September 20. P09-v2 covered September 20 only.','The September 21 release is outside both windows; complete history explicitly excludes extension/replacement. Archived existence is not operative authority.'],'Report the missing in-force permit for this specific release.','Audit.p09Covers 21 = false'),
('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['G03','AL01','AL03','N21-01'],'Does the September 21 north-operator signature identify credentialed Ada?',['The dated complete alias register reassigns north-operator from Ada to Ben on September 21.','Ben activates only September 22; Ada\'s active credential and earlier alias usage cannot transfer to Ben\'s signature.'],'Resolve the signature to Ben and record the inactive credential at that event.','Audit.northOperator 21 ≠ Audit.Principal.ada'),
('supported','sufficient','proved',['AU01','AU02','AL02','N41-01'],'Was Devon\'s N41 approval on September 20 at 09:00 within both node and time scope?',['The signed delegation covers N41–N50 inclusive from September 18 00:00 through September 25 23:59.','Node 41 is included and the September 20 approval is strictly inside the authorized interval.'],'Retain the scoped approval finding without generalizing to N51.','Audit.delegated 41 20 = true'),
('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['G02','AU01','AU04','REQ02','N51-01','EX03'],'Did Devon\'s genuine signature authorize N51 regardless of delegation scope?',['N51 is outside the inclusive N41–N50 grant, and its expansion request was expressly declined.','Complete approval/amendment histories exclude another approval; the board register excludes an exception. Authenticity cannot replace the required scoped-approval conjunct.'],'Record that this genuine approval lacked node authority.','Audit.delegated 51 20 = false ∧ Audit.routeB true (Audit.delegated 51 20) true = false'),
('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['G03','AU03','EX01','EX02','N57-01'],'Was N57 unauthorized solely because ordinary central approval/permit were absent?',['The final authorized board grant expressly replaces those ordinary requirements for N57 on September 22 09:00–12:00.','The 10:00 release matches node/time; active Ada and Emil\'s 09:00 local approval satisfy the exception conditions.','Using only the general rule ignores an incorporated cross-document exception.'],'Recognize this N57 release as authorized under the narrow board exception.','Audit.exceptionRoute 57 22 10 true true = true'),
('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['REQ01','AU03','EX01','EX02','EX03','N58-01'],'Did the two-node request itself extend the final exception to N58?',['The request proposed N57 and N58, but the final signed grant intentionally includes N57 only.','The board\'s power to grant and a request do not establish a grant. The complete board register excludes another N58 exception.'],'Apply the final grant\'s N57-only scope.','Audit.boardScope 58 22 10 = false'),
('refuted','invalid_inference','refuted',['G02','G03','PV03','N58-01'],'Was N58 revocation ineffective at its 10:00 release because indexing occurred at 11:00?',['The signed revocation explicitly takes effect at 09:00, before release at 10:00.','Indexing at 11:00 is a later recording event, not the operative time. Complete history confirms no replacement.'],'Use the 09:00 effective time; retain the later index time only as provenance.','(9 : Nat) < 10 ∧ 10 < 11'),
('undetermined','insufficient_support','blocked',['G04','N59-01','EX03'],'Does the absent N59 attachment establish that its release was unauthorized?',['Active operator and valid Cora approval are documented, but the permit history is expressly incomplete.','No revocation, complete negative permit record, or other contrary fact is supplied. Full relevant corpus review finds the same unresolved gap, not proof of permit absence.'],'Request the covering permit/history; report authorization as unresolved rather than categorical failure.',None),
('undetermined','insufficient_support','blocked',['G01','G04','N60-01','RG05'],'Was N60-R1 the sole September release?',['One September 20 authorized release is established, but the event-history export omits September 26–30.','Complete authorization evidence for the known event does not establish that no additional events occurred; the identity registry cannot repair the event gap.'],'Retain the known event and request the missing interval export before an exact monthly count.',None),
